</p>n          </div>n        </a>n        <a class=\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/recepcao-dos-estudantes-2026-1/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/PHOTO-2026-03-18-16-03-28.jpg\');\">n          <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__content\">n            <span class=\"fisica-home-carousel__label\">Vida acad&ecirc;mica</span>n            <h3>Recep&ccedil;&atilde;o dos Estudantes 2026/1 integra calouros, veteranos e comunidade acad&ecirc;mica</h3>n            <p>Programa&ccedil;&atilde;o de acolhimento aproximou estudantes, egressos, laborat&oacute;rios e iniciativas de cuidado com a sa&uacute;de mental no in&iacute;cio do per&iacute;odo letivo.</p>n          </div>n        </a>n        <a class=\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/formatura-da-turma-de-2025-2/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-05-at-15.51.44.jpeg\');\">n          <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__content\">n            <span class=\"fisica-home-carousel__label\">Vida acadu00eamica</span>n            <h3>Instituto de Fu00edsica celebra formatura da turma de 2025/2</h3>n            <p>Depois de vu00e1rios anos, o Instituto de Fu00edsica da UERJ voltou a realizar uma festa de formatura de Licenciatura e Bacharelado, celebrando a conclusu00e3o de 20 estudantes da turma de 2025/2.</p>n          </div>n        </a>n        <a class=\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/instituto-de-fisica-recebe-novos-equipamentos-fisica-moderna/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image0.jpeg\');\">n          <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__content\">n            <span class=\"fisica-home-carousel__label\">Infraestrutura</span>n            <h3>Instituto de Fu00edsica recebe novos equipamentos para Fu00edsica Moderna</h3>n            <p>Aquisiu00e7u00e3o fortalece o ensino experimental e amplia a formau00e7u00e3o cientu00edfica dos estudantes de Fu00edsica.</p>n          </div>n        </a>n        <a class=\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/lancamento-livro-memorias-de-vida-professor-alberto-santoro/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-24-at-12.59.29-1.jpeg\');background-position:center 25%;\">n          <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__content\">n            <span class=\"fisica-home-carousel__label\">Memu00f3ria institucional</span>n            <h3>Instituto de Fu00edsica celebra lanu00e7amento do livro do Professor Alberto Santoro</h3>n            <p>O Instituto de Fu00edsica da UERJ celebrou o lanu00e7amento de u201cMemu00f3rias de vidau201d, obra do Professor Alberto Santoro que reu00fane histu00f3rias profissionais, familiares e registros de uma trajetu00f3ria fundamental para a Fu00edsica na Universidade.</p>n          </div>n        </a>n                </div>nn      <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__controls\">n        <button class=\"fisica-home-carousel__button\" type=\"button\" data-carousel-prev aria-label=\"Slide anterior\">&#10094;</button>n        <div class=\"fisica-home-carousel__dots\" data-carousel-dots></div>n        <button class=\"fisica-home-carousel__button\" type=\"button\" data-carousel-next aria-label=\"Pr&oacute;ximo slide\">&#10095;</button>n      </div>n    </div>n  </div>n</section>nn<script>n(() => {n  const root = document.querySelector(\'[data-carousel]\');n  if (!root || root.dataset.ready === \'true\') {n    return;n  }n  root.dataset.ready = \'true\';nn  const track = root.querySelector(\'.fisica-home-carousel__track\');n  const slides = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(\'.fisica-home-carousel__slide\'));n  const next = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-next]\');n  const prev = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-prev]\');n  const dotsWrap = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-dots]\');nn  if (!track || !slides.length || !next || !prev || !dotsWrap) {n    return;n  }nn  let index = 0;n  let timer = null;nn  const dots = slides.map((_, i) => {n    const dot = document.createElement(\'button\');n    dot.type = \'button\';n    dot.className = \'fisica-home-carousel__dot\';n    dot.setAttribute(\'aria-label\', `Ir para slide ${i + 1}`);n    dot.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {n      goTo(i);n      restart();n    });n    dotsWrap.appendChild(dot);n    return dot;n  });nn  function render() {n    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * 100}%)`;n    dots.forEach((dot, dotIndex) => {n      dot.classList.toggle(\'is-active\', dotIndex === index);n    });n  }nn  function goTo(nextIndex) {n    index = (nextIndex + slides.length) % slides.length;n    render();n  }nn  function restart() {n    window.clearInterval(timer);n    timer = window.setInterval(() => goTo(index + 1), 5500);n  }nn  next.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {n    goTo(index + 1);n    restart();n  });nn  prev.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {n    goTo(index - 1);n    restart();n  });nn  render();n  restart();n})();n</script>tttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-homeevents1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"homeevents1\" data-element_type=\"container\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eventhtml1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"eventhtml1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">nttttt<section class=\"fisica-home-section\">n  <div class=\"fisica-home-section__head\">n    <div>n      <span class=\"fisica-home-section__eyebrow\">Eventos e Destaques</span>n      <!--<h2>Acontece no instituto</h2>-->n      <!--<p>Um bloco mais organizado para divulgar atividades, imagens e acontecimentos relevantes da comunidade acadu00eamica.</p>-->n    </div>n  </div>nnn  <div class=\"fisica-events-grid\">n    <a class=\"fisica-events-card\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/universo-como-laboratorio-fisica-fundamental-mev-zev/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-09-at-15.56.58.jpeg\');\">n      <div class=\"fisica-events-card__content\">n        <span class=\"fisica-events-card__tag\">Colu00f3quio</span>n        <h3>O Universo como laboratu00f3rio de fu00edsica fundamental: de MeV a ZeV.</h3>n        <p>O colu00f3quio abordaru00e1 como a fu00edsica de astropartu00edculas utiliza o Universo para investigar fenu00f4menos extremos e buscar sinais de nova fu00edsica, com destaque para neutrinos, raios cu00f3smicos, matu00e9ria escura e ondas gravitacionais. Seru00e3o apresentados resultados e perspectivas dos experimentos Pierre Auger, DUNE e GRAND.</p>n      </div>n    </a>n    <a class=\"fisica-events-card fisica-events-card--optics-workshop\" href=\"https://doity.com.br/2o-workshop-de-ptica-aplicada-da-uerj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-8-de-set.-de-2026-12_00_38.png\');\">n      <div class=\"fisica-events-card__content\">n        <span class=\"fisica-events-card__tag\">Workshop</span>n        <h3>2u00ba Workshop de u00d3ptica Aplicada da UERJ 2026</h3>n        <p>Entre os dias 8 e 10 de setembro de 2026, o Instituto de Fu00edsica da UERJ reuniru00e1 estudantes, pesquisadores e profissionais para discutir avanu00e7os, aplicau00e7u00f5es e temas emergentes da u00d3ptica Aplicada, com atividades cientu00edficas, intercu00e2mbio de experiu00eancias e apresentau00e7u00e3o de trabalhos.</p>n      </div>n    </a>n    <a class=\"fisica-events-card\" href=\"http://localhost/fisica/index.php/rpc-2026-na-uerj-abre-inscricoes-e-submissao-de-resumos/\" style=\"background-image:url(\'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Captura-de-tela-2026-05-14-152836.png\');\">n      <div class=\"fisica-events-card__content\">n        <span class=\"fisica-events-card__tag\">Evento internacional</span>n        <h3>RPC 2026 na UERJ abre inscriu00e7u00f5es e submissu00e3o de resumos</h3>n        <p>UERJ sediaru00e1 pela primeira vez no Brasil e na Amu00e9rica do Sul a International Conference on Resistive Plate Chambers and Related Detectors (RPC 2026), reunindo pesquisadores e especialistas de diversos pau00edses.</p>n      </div>n    </a>n  </div>n</section>tttt</div>ntttt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-labsanchor1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"labsanchor1\" data-element_type=\"container\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-labshtml1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"labshtml1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">nttttt<div id=\"laboratorios\"></div>tttt</div>ntt[elementor-element k=\"a57bdd96302df60f4542e9be451ee5f5\" data=\"eyJpZCI6ImxhYnNzaG9ydDEiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJzaG9ydGNvZGUiOiJbaWNvbmVzX3NlcnZpY29zX3VlcmpdIn0sImVsZW1lbnRzIjpbXSwid2lkZ2V0VHlwZSI6InNob3J0Y29kZSJ9\"]tt</div>ntt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-programanchor1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"programanchor1\" data-element_type=\"container\">ntttt<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-programhtml1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"programhtml1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">nttttt<div id=\"programas\"></div>tttt</div>ntt[elementor-element k=\"a57bdd96302df60f4542e9be451ee5f5\" data=\"eyJpZCI6InByb2dyYW1zaG9ydDEiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJzaG9ydGNvZGUiOiJbcXVhZHJhZG9zX3NlcnZpY29zX2xpbmtdIn0sImVsZW1lbnRzIjpbXSwid2lkZ2V0VHlwZSI6InNob3J0Y29kZSJ9\"]tt</div>ntt\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),(9142,1435,'_wp_attached_file','2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-15-at-11.23.18.jpeg'),(9143,1435,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1600;s:6:\"height\";i:720;s:4:\"file\";s:50:\"2026/09/WhatsApp-Image-2026-09-15-